WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.302
Common table expressions are not automatically better.

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:06.527
A short query may be clearer without one.

00:00:06.527 --> 00:00:11.152
A common table expression also does not repair unclear grain.

00:00:11.152 --> 00:00:14.667
And it does not automatically make a query faster.

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:19.130
Use named stages when they improve reasoning and maintainability.
